    },
    {
      "entryId": "2pe-3-8",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The beloved are corrected on chronology. First principle: divine timekeeping dilutes impatience — the thousand-years/day symmetry makes delay impossible to measure by clocks.",
